# The light crystals (Models/gems.obj) drawn UNLIT, so a `Color` with an `Emissive` strength GLOWS on them (the
# bloom takes it). The buildings' `Crystal` pieces use this container. No ray tracing: a crystal casts no shadow.
ObjectContainer gemsGlow
	Path "Models/gems.obj"
	MaterialOverrides
		PipelineIdx UnlitOpaque
		ExcludeFromRayTracing true
